#: maxframe.learn.linear_model._logistic.LogisticRegression:1 of
msgid "Logistic Regression (aka logit, MaxEnt) classifier."
msgstr "逻辑回归（又称logit、MaxEnt）分类器。"

#: maxframe.learn.linear_model._logistic.LogisticRegression:3 of
msgid ""
"This class implements regularized logistic regression using the specified"
" solver. **Note that regularization is applied by default**. It can "
"handle both dense and sparse input. Use C-ordered arrays or CSR matrices "
"containing 64-bit floats for optimal performance; any other input format "
"will be converted (and copied)."
msgstr ""
"此类使用指定的求解器实现正则化逻辑回归。**请注意，默认情况下应用正则化**"
"。它可以处理密集和稀疏输入。为获得最佳性能，请使用包含64位浮点数的C顺序"
"数组或CSR矩阵；任何其他输入格式都将被转换（和复制）。"

#: maxframe.learn.linear_model._logistic.LogisticRegression:10 of
msgid ""
"This is a MaxFrame distributed implementation. Supported solvers are "
"``lbfgs``, ``newton-cg``, ``newton-cholesky``, and ``liblinear``. The "
"``multi_class`` parameter is intentionally not provided, following "
"scikit-learn's deprecation (removed in sklearn 1.8). Multiclass problems "
"always use the multinomial loss. The ``liblinear`` solver supports binary"
" classification only; use ``OneVsRestClassifier`` for OvR multiclass."
msgstr ""
"这是一个MaxFrame分布式实现。支持的求解器包括``lbfgs``、``newton-cg``、``"
"newton-cholesky``和``liblinear``。``multi_class``参数故意不提供，遵循"
"scikit-learn的弃用（在sklearn 1.8中移除）。多类问题始终使用多项式损失。``"
"liblinear``求解器仅支持二元分类；对于OvR多类问题，请使用``"
"OneVsRestClassifier``。"

