#: maxframe.learn.linear_model._logistic.LogisticRegression:18 of
msgid ""
"Used to specify the norm used in the penalization. Not all penalties are "
"supported by all solvers:  ==========  ================================ "
"Penalty     Supported solvers ==========  "
"================================ l1          liblinear l2          lbfgs,"
" newton-cg, newton-cholesky, liblinear elasticnet  lbfgs none        "
"lbfgs, newton-cg, newton-cholesky ==========  "
"================================  If 'none', no regularization is "
"applied."
msgstr ""
"用于指定惩罚中使用的范数。并非所有求解器都支持所有惩罚：==========  ====="
"=========================== 惩罚     支持的求解器 ==========  ==========="
"===================== l1          liblinear l2          lbfgs, newton-cg,"
" newton-cholesky, liblinear elasticnet  lbfgs none        lbfgs, newton-"
"cg, newton-cholesky ==========  ================================  如果为'"
"none'，则不应用正则化。"

