#: maxframe.learn.linear_model._logistic.LogisticRegression:32 of
msgid ""
"Inverse of regularization strength; must be a positive float. Smaller "
"values specify stronger regularization."
msgstr "正则化强度的倒数；必须是正浮点数。较小的值指定更强的正则化。"

#: maxframe.learn.linear_model._logistic.LogisticRegression:35 of
msgid ""
"Specifies if a constant (a.k.a. bias or intercept) should be added to the"
" decision function."
msgstr "指定是否应向决策函数添加常数（即偏置或截距）。"

#: maxframe.learn.linear_model._logistic.LogisticRegression:38 of
msgid "Seed for the random number generator used to initialize coefficients."
msgstr "用于初始化系数的随机数生成器的种子。"

#: maxframe.learn.linear_model._logistic.LogisticRegression:40 of
msgid ""
"Algorithm to use in the optimization problem.  - ``lbfgs``: Uses "
"scipy.optimize.minimize with L-BFGS-B.   Supports l1, l2, elasticnet, and"
" none penalties.   Multiclass: multinomial. - ``newton-cg``: Newton's "
"method with CG linear solver.   Supports l2 and none penalties only.   "
"Multiclass: multinomial. - ``newton-cholesky``: Newton's method with "
"Cholesky factorization.   Supports l2 and none penalties only.   "
"Multiclass: multinomial. - ``liblinear``: Coordinate descent (wraps "
"LIBLINEAR).   Supports l1 and l2 penalties only.   Binary classification "
"only (raises ValueError for n_classes > 2).  .. note::    ``newton-cg`` "
"and ``newton-cholesky`` compute the full Hessian    matrix and require it"
" to fit into AM memory. For high-dimensional    data, ``lbfgs`` is "
"recommended."
msgstr ""
"优化问题中使用的算法。  - ``lbfgs``: 使用scipy.optimize.minimize和L-BFGS-"
"B。   支持l1、l2、elasticnet和none惩罚。   多类：多项式。 - ``newton-cg``"
": 带CG线性求解器的牛顿法。   仅支持l2和none惩罚。   多类：多项式。 - ``"
"newton-cholesky``: 带Cholesky分解的牛顿法。   仅支持l2和none惩罚。   多类"
"：多项式。 - ``liblinear``: 坐标下降（包装LIBLINEAR）。   仅支持l1和l2"
"惩罚。   仅二元分类（当n_classes > 2时引发ValueError）。  .. note::    ``"
"newton-cg`` 和``newton-cholesky``计算完整的Hessian    矩阵并要求其适合AM"
"内存。对于高维    数据，推荐使用``lbfgs``。"

#: maxframe.learn.linear_model._logistic.LogisticRegression:40 of
msgid "Algorithm to use in the optimization problem."
msgstr "优化问题中使用的算法。"

#: maxframe.learn.linear_model._logistic.LogisticRegression:42 of
msgid ""
"``lbfgs``: Uses scipy.optimize.minimize with L-BFGS-B. Supports l1, l2, "
"elasticnet, and none penalties. Multiclass: multinomial."
msgstr ""
"``lbfgs``: 使用scipy.optimize.minimize和L-BFGS-B。支持l1、l2、elasticnet"
"和none惩罚。多类：多项式。"

#: maxframe.learn.linear_model._logistic.LogisticRegression:45 of
msgid ""
"``newton-cg``: Newton's method with CG linear solver. Supports l2 and "
"none penalties only. Multiclass: multinomial."
msgstr "``newton-cg``: 带CG线性求解器的牛顿法。仅支持l2和none惩罚。多类：多项式。"

#: maxframe.learn.linear_model._logistic.LogisticRegression:48 of
msgid ""
"``newton-cholesky``: Newton's method with Cholesky factorization. "
"Supports l2 and none penalties only. Multiclass: multinomial."
msgstr ""
"``newton-cholesky``: 带Cholesky分解的牛顿法。仅支持l2和none惩罚。多类："
"多项式。"

#: maxframe.learn.linear_model._logistic.LogisticRegression:51 of
msgid ""
"``liblinear``: Coordinate descent (wraps LIBLINEAR). Supports l1 and l2 "
"penalties only. Binary classification only (raises ValueError for "
"n_classes > 2)."
msgstr ""
"``liblinear``: 坐标下降（包装LIBLINEAR）。仅支持l1和l2 惩罚。仅二元分类（"
"当n_classes > 2时引发ValueError）。"

#: maxframe.learn.linear_model._logistic.LogisticRegression:56 of
msgid ""
"``newton-cg`` and ``newton-cholesky`` compute the full Hessian matrix and"
" require it to fit into AM memory. For high-dimensional data, ``lbfgs`` "
"is recommended."
msgstr ""
"``newton-cg``和``newton-cholesky``计算完整的Hessian矩阵并要求其适合AM内存"
"。对于高维数据，推荐使用``lbfgs``。"

#: maxframe.learn.linear_model._logistic.LogisticRegression:60 of
msgid ""
"Dual or primal formulation. Dual formulation is only implemented for l2 "
"penalty with liblinear solver. Prefer dual=False when n_samples > "
"n_features.  .. note::    This parameter is only used by the "
"``liblinear`` solver.    For other solvers, this parameter has no effect."
msgstr ""
"对偶或原始公式。对偶公式仅针对使用liblinear求解器的l2惩罚实现。当n_"
"samples > n_features时，建议使用dual=False。  .. note::    此参数仅由``"
"liblinear``求解器使用。    对于其他求解器，此参数无效。"

#: maxframe.learn.linear_model._logistic.LogisticRegression:60 of
msgid ""
"Dual or primal formulation. Dual formulation is only implemented for l2 "
"penalty with liblinear solver. Prefer dual=False when n_samples > "
"n_features."
msgstr ""
"对偶或原始公式。对偶公式仅针对使用liblinear求解器的l2惩罚实现。当n_"
"samples > n_features时，建议使用dual=False。"

#: maxframe.learn.linear_model._logistic.LogisticRegression:65
#: maxframe.learn.linear_model._logistic.LogisticRegression:80 of
msgid ""
"This parameter is only used by the ``liblinear`` solver. For other "
"solvers, this parameter has no effect."
msgstr "此参数仅由``liblinear``求解器使用。对于其他求解器，此参数无效。"

#: maxframe.learn.linear_model._logistic.LogisticRegression:68 of
msgid ""
"Useful only when solver='liblinear' and fit_intercept=True. In this case,"
" the intercept term is scaled by intercept_scaling (i.e. a \"synthetic\" "
"feature with constant value equal to intercept_scaling is added to the "
"instance vector). The intercept becomes intercept_scaling * "
"synthetic_feature_weight.  .. note::    The synthetic feature weight is "
"subject to l1/l2 regularization    as all other features. To lessen the "
"effect of regularization on    the intercept term, increase "
"intercept_scaling.  .. note::    This parameter is only used by the "
"``liblinear`` solver.    For other solvers, this parameter has no effect."
msgstr ""
"仅在solver='liblinear'和fit_intercept=True时有用。在这种情况下，截距项按"
"intercept_scaling进行缩放（即向实例向量添加一个常数值等于intercept_"
"scaling的\"合成\"特征）。截距变为intercept_scaling * synthetic_feature_"
"weight。  .. note::    合成特征权重与其他所有特征一样受l1/l2正则化约束。"
"为减轻正则化对截距项的影响，请增加intercept_scaling。  .. note::    "
"此参数仅由``liblinear``求解器使用。    对于其他求解器，此参数无效。"

#: maxframe.learn.linear_model._logistic.LogisticRegression:68 of
msgid ""
"Useful only when solver='liblinear' and fit_intercept=True. In this case,"
" the intercept term is scaled by intercept_scaling (i.e. a \"synthetic\" "
"feature with constant value equal to intercept_scaling is added to the "
"instance vector). The intercept becomes intercept_scaling * "
"synthetic_feature_weight."
msgstr ""
"仅在solver='liblinear'和fit_intercept=True时有用。在这种情况下，截距项按"
"intercept_scaling进行缩放（即向实例向量添加一个常数值等于intercept_"
"scaling的\"合成\"特征）。截距变为intercept_scaling * synthetic_feature_"
"weight。"

#: maxframe.learn.linear_model._logistic.LogisticRegression:75 of
msgid ""
"The synthetic feature weight is subject to l1/l2 regularization as all "
"other features. To lessen the effect of regularization on the intercept "
"term, increase intercept_scaling."
msgstr ""
"合成特征权重与其他所有特征一样受l1/l2正则化约束。为减轻正则化对截距项的"
"影响，请增加intercept_scaling。"

#: maxframe.learn.linear_model._logistic.LogisticRegression:83 of
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"Weights associated with classes in the form ``{class_label: weight}``. If"
" not given, all classes are supposed to have weight one.  The "
"\"balanced\" mode uses the values of y to automatically adjust weights "
"inversely proportional to class frequencies in the input data as "
"``n_samples / (n_classes * np.bincount(y))``.  .. note::    class_weight "
"is converted to per-sample weights before fitting and    combined with "
"sample_weight if both are provided. This is equivalent    to passing "
"class_weight directly for all solvers including liblinear."
msgstr ""
"以``{class_label: weight}``形式关联类别的权重。如果未给出，则假定所有类别"
"都具有权重一。  \"balanced\"模式使用y的值自动调整权重，使其与输入数据中的"
"类别频率成反比，即``n_samples / (n_classes * np.bincount(y))``。  .. note"
"::    class_weight在拟合前转换为每样本权重，如果同时提供了sample_weight，"
"则与之结合。这等效于直接为包括liblinear在内的所有求解器传递class_weight。"

#: maxframe.learn.linear_model._logistic.LogisticRegression:83 of
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"Weights associated with classes in the form ``{class_label: weight}``. If"
" not given, all classes are supposed to have weight one."
msgstr ""
"以``{class_label: weight}``形式关联类别的权重。如果未给出，则假定所有类别"
"都具有权重一。"

#: maxframe.learn.linear_model._logistic.LogisticRegression:86 of
msgid ""
"The \"balanced\" mode uses the values of y to automatically adjust "
"weights inversely proportional to class frequencies in the input data as "
"``n_samples / (n_classes * np.bincount(y))``."
msgstr ""
"\"balanced\"模式使用y的值自动调整权重，使其与输入数据中的类别频率成反比，"
"即``n_samples / (n_classes * np.bincount(y))``。"

#: maxframe.learn.linear_model._logistic.LogisticRegression:91 of
msgid ""
"class_weight is converted to per-sample weights before fitting and "
"combined with sample_weight if both are provided. This is equivalent to "
"passing class_weight directly for all solvers including liblinear."
msgstr ""
"class_weight在拟合前转换为每样本权重，如果同时提供了sample_weight，则与之"
"结合。这等效于直接为包括liblinear在内的所有求解器传递class_weight。"

#: maxframe.learn.linear_model._logistic.LogisticRegression:95 of
msgid "Maximum number of iterations taken for the solver to converge."
msgstr "求解器收敛所需的最大迭代次数。"

#: maxframe.learn.linear_model._logistic.LogisticRegression:97 of
msgid ""
"For the lbfgs solver set verbose to any positive number for verbosity.  "
".. note:: Not yet implemented. Currently has no effect on the    "
