msgstr ""
"对于lbfgs求解器，将verbose设置为任意正数以获得详细输出。  .. note:: 尚未"
"实现。目前对优化过程没有影响。"

#: maxframe.learn.linear_model._logistic.LogisticRegression:97 of
msgid "For the lbfgs solver set verbose to any positive number for verbosity."
msgstr "对于lbfgs求解器，将verbose设置为任意正数以获得详细输出。"

#: maxframe.learn.linear_model._logistic.LogisticRegression:100 of
msgid "Not yet implemented. Currently has no effect on the optimization process."
msgstr "尚未实现。目前对优化过程没有影响。"

#: maxframe.learn.linear_model._logistic.LogisticRegression:103 of
msgid ""
"When set to True, reuse the solution of the previous call to fit as "
"initialization, otherwise, just erase the previous solution."
msgstr ""
"当设置为 True 时，重用上一次调用拟合的解作为初始化，否则，仅清除上一次的"
"解。"

#: maxframe.learn.linear_model._logistic.LogisticRegression:106 of
msgid ""
"The Elastic-Net mixing parameter, with ``0 <= l1_ratio <= 1``. Only used "
"if ``penalty='elasticnet'``. Setting ``l1_ratio=0`` is equivalent to "
"using ``penalty='l2'``, while ``l1_ratio=1`` is equivalent to using "
"``penalty='l1'``."
msgstr ""
"Elastic-Net 混合参数，范围为 ``0 <= l1_ratio <= 1``。仅在 ``penalty='"
"elasticnet'`` 时使用。设置 ``l1_ratio=0`` 等价于使用 ``penalty='l2'``，而"
" ``l1_ratio=1`` 等价于使用 ``penalty='l1'``。"

#: maxframe.learn.linear_model._logistic.LogisticRegression:114 of
